This distribution is the Python binding of the Rust core of sdm-client: one
native extension module, sdm_core._native, built from first-party source in
the repository's rust/ directory. It has no runtime dependencies.

The module links statically, at the versions rust/Cargo.lock pins, the
third-party Rust crates that source depends on, among them arrow-rs, PyO3,
serde and serde_json. Their licences are limited by rust/deny.toml to ones
compatible with Apache-2.0: today Apache-2.0, MIT, BSD-2-Clause and the
Unlicense, most crates offering a choice of them. This distribution is
internal and unpublished; their licence texts are to be bundled here before
it is published.
